Place the Python script and CSV dataset in the same directory.

Run:

python athlete_performance_visualization.py
Visualizations
The program generates five visualizations:
Training Load Trend
Shows how training load changes across observations for each athlete.

Readiness Trend
Shows changes in athlete readiness over time.

Average Training Load
Compares average training load between athletes.

Average Jump Height
Compares average jump performance between athletes.

Training Load vs Readiness

Shows the relationship between training load and readiness observations.

