Limitations

The dataset is synthetic and is intended for programming and portfolio development.

The variables and relationships should not be interpreted as validated clinical, physiological, or performance-monitoring thresholds.

Correlation does not establish causation.
Real athlete-performance systems should use validated testing protocols, appropriate measurement reliability, athlete-specific baselines, longitudinal data, and qualified professional interpretation.